# L §3.2 Exchange rates: "A rate applies only from B to A (U-05): a money A or num A times num A/B ... is refused
# (LOAD-UNIT), though the unit algebra above would give it a unit."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input a: money PLN
input fx: num PLN/EUR

ask q1: a * fx
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
